  {
   "id": "es.1.7.3",
   "title": "e → i 与“我”的不规则形式",
   "steps": [
    {
     "t": "intro",
     "title": "你在做什么？",
     "lines": [
      [
       "A",
       "¿Qué haces esta tarde?",
       "你今天下午做什么？"
      ],
      [
       "B",
       "Hago los deberes y luego salgo con unos amigos.",
       "做作业，然后和朋友出去。"
      ],
      [
       "A",
       "¿Conoces a mi hermana?",
       "你认识我妹妹吗？"
      ],
      [
       "B",
       "No, no la conozco. Y no sé dónde vive.",
       "不认识。也不知道她住哪儿。"
      ]
     ],
     "note": "hago、salgo、conozco、sé：有一批动词只有“我”这一格不规则。"
    },
    {
     "t": "teach",
     "title": "e → i：pedir, repetir, seguir",
     "body": [
      "只有 -ir 动词有 e → i：pedir → p<b>i</b>do, p<b>i</b>des, p<b>i</b>de, pedimos, pedís, p<b>i</b>den",
      "repetir → repito；seguir → sigo；vestirse → me visto",
      "请人重复：<b>¿Puede repetir, por favor?</b>"
     ],
     "ex": [
      [
       "¿Puede repetir, por favor?",
       "您能再说一遍吗？"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "word",
     "w": "pedir"
    },
    {
     "t": "word",
     "w": "repetir"
    },
    {
     "t": "word",
     "w": "hacer"
    },
    {
     "t": "word",
     "w": "poner"
    },
    {
     "t": "word",
     "w": "salir"
    },
    {
     "t": "word",
     "w": "decir"
    },
    {
     "t": "key",
     "title": "只有 yo 不规则的动词：hago, salgo, pongo…",
     "what": [
      "这些动词只有 yo 形式特别，其余五格完全规则：",
      "<b>hacer → hago</b>（haces, hace…）　<b>poner → pongo</b>　<b>salir → salgo</b>　<b>traer → traigo</b>",
      "<b>saber → sé</b>　<b>conocer → conozco</b>　<b>dar → doy</b>　<b>ver → veo</b>",
      "<b>yo 不规则 + 词干变化</b>：tener → tengo, tienes；venir → vengo, vienes；decir → digo, dices"
     ],
     "why": [
      "-go 结尾的一组（hago, pongo, salgo, traigo, tengo, vengo, digo）是一个“家族”，一起记最快。"
     ],
     "zh": [
      "这些都是最常用的动词，yo 形式又最常说，所以错误非常显眼：<s>yo haco</s>、<s>yo salo</s>、<s>yo sabo</s>。"
     ],
     "ex": [
      [
       "Hago los deberes por la tarde.",
       "我下午做作业。"
      ],
      [
       "Salgo de casa a las ocho.",
       "我八点出门。"
      ],
      [
       "No sé.",
       "我不知道。"
      ],
      [
       "Vengo mañana.",
       "我明天来。"
      ]
     ],
     "err": [
      [
       "Yo haco",
       "Yo hago",
       ""
      ],
      [
       "Yo salo",
       "Yo salgo",
       ""
      ],
      [
       "Yo sabo",
       "Yo sé",
       ""
      ]
     ],
     "sum": "<b>-go 家族</b>：hago, pongo, salgo, traigo, tengo, vengo, digo；另记 sé, conozco, doy, veo。",
     "drill": [
